FamilyRoots Platform - Comprehensive Full-Stack Audit & Gap Analysis Report
===================================================================================
Platform: FamilyRoots ("Family Together")
Backend: NestJS 11 + Prisma 7 ORM + PostgreSQL + Redis
Frontend: Next.js 16 + React 19 + Redux Toolkit + TailwindCSS v4
Audit Date: October 2026

1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
A rigorous, line-by-line audit across both family-together-backend and family-together-frontend
was conducted to evaluate endpoint coverage, UI connectivity, database schema completeness,
and feature gaps.

2. MISSING APIS & INCOMPLETE FEATURES IDENTIFIED
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[CRITICAL] 1. Relationship Deletion & Modification (Unlinking Relatives)
- Missing Endpoints: DELETE /family/relationships/:id and PATCH /family/relationships/:id
- Missing UI: In RelationshipsTab.tsx, table has no actions column to unlink or edit relationships.
- Problem: If an owner connects two relatives incorrectly, there is no way to remove the link.

[HIGH] 2. Member Biographical Editing in Members Directory
- Missing Endpoint: GET /family/members/:id (single member deep lookup).
- Missing UI: In MembersTab.tsx, cards only have a Delete button; no "Edit Member" modal exists
  to modify biographical info (birth date, death date, occupation, birthplace, bio).

[HIGH] 3. Event RSVP & Attendees System
- Missing Schema: Event model in vault.prisma has no RSVP model or attendee status relation.
- Missing Endpoints: POST /family/events/:id/rsvp and GET /family/events/:id/rsvps
- Missing UI: In EventsTab.tsx, no RSVP buttons (Attending / Maybe / Declined) or attendee avatars.

[HIGH] 4. Invitation Email Dispatch & Public Acceptance Portal
- Missing Logic: InvitationsService.createInvitation does not call MailService to dispatch emails.
- Missing Endpoint: POST /family/invitations/accept (for accepting an invite).
- Missing UI: No /join or /accept-invitation page in Next.js frontend.

[MEDIUM] 5. Multi-Member Group Conversations
- Missing Endpoint: POST /family/chat/conversations/group (creating named multi-user group chats).
- Missing UI: MessagesTab only supports direct 1-on-1 chats; no "Create Group" dialog exists.

[MEDIUM] 6. Super Admin Live Data Binding
- Missing UI Wiring: In /admin-dashboard/super, privileged admins table, 1.2M users stat,
  and security audit alerts are hardcoded static strings instead of querying live APIs.

[MEDIUM] 7. Network Analytics Visual Charts
- Missing UI: Generational Tree Growth and Relationship Distribution in /admin-dashboard/analytics
  render empty grey boxes with placeholder text.

[LOW/ENHANCEMENT] 8. Memory Person Tagging
- Missing Schema: Memory model lacks relation to tag individual Person records in photos/stories.

3. RECOMMENDED RESOLUTION ROADMAP
- Phase 1: Implement Relationship DELETE/PATCH & Member Edit Modal.
- Phase 2: Implement Invitation Email dispatch & public /join acceptance page.
- Phase 3: Add Event RSVP model and attendee controls; add Group Chat creation.
- Phase 4: Bind live stats to Super Admin and render SVG charts in Analytics.

